Subject: [PATCH] Full-screen confetti and savings popup when UPI is selected
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Confetti fires from both bottom corners and floats down across the screen,
with a 'You saved ₹X!' popup that springs in and closes itself (tap to close).
Plays when checkout loads with UPI selected and each time UPI is re-selected.
Respects reduced-motion settings.

